= The Killing of George Floyd

The killing of George Floyd by a police officer in Minneapolis has sparked the largest protests in American history, from small towns to big cities. Some protests turn to rioting and looting; the president threatens to deploy troops.

- @floyd_reform: Back reform and peaceful protest
- @floyd_defund: Embrace the most radical demands
- @floyd_order: Stress law and order

@floyd_reform
on-arrival: minority_dem += 4*(1-dissent); young_dem += 3*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 1*(1-dissent); directleft_militancy -= 0.05; progressive_dissent -= 3; polarization += 1

We call for concrete reforms and condemn violence in the same breath.

@floyd_defund
on-arrival: young_dem += 3*(1-dissent); minority_dem += 1*(1-dissent); suburban_dem -= 4*(1-dissent); working_dem -= 2*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent -= 6; moderate_dissent += 8; directleft_strength += 10; polarization += 2; gop_enthusiasm += 1

The slogan spreads faster than the policy. Opponents have a new weapon.

@floyd_order
on-arrival: suburban_dem += 3*(1-dissent); working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); minority_dem -= 3*(1-dissent); young_dem -= 3*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent += 8; farleft_strength += 2; local_police_loyalty += 0.05

We prioritize safety. Our base accuses us of betrayal.
